     "type": "intro",
     "title": "Welcome to Local SEO Domination",
     "content": "Welcome to a seven-lesson seminar built from twenty years of running local SEO campaigns and ten years of teaching it inside university digital marketing programs. Local search is its own discipline. Ranking a national e-commerce store and ranking a roofer in Tulsa look similar on the surface and play by very different rules underneath. This lesson is your foundation: how Google's local algorithm actually works, why the map pack is the most valuable real estate on the internet for service businesses, and the three factor families every modern local SEO loop is built around — proximity, relevance, and prominence.",
